PART 2 -- SYMBOLIC AUDIT OF THE TANGENCY COLLAPSE (sympy 1.9)
==============================================================================
  (K)  H(rho)+rho log2 - A(1+gamma rho)      == 0   PROVED-symbolic
  D = gamma(1+tau)/(1+gamma rho)             == 0: True
  (V) - [2log(1-tau)-log(tau)]               == 0   PROVED-symbolic
  root of (1-tau)^2 = tau in (0,1):  tau* = 3/2 - sqrt(5)/2
    tau* - phi^-2                            == 0
    u* = (1-tau*)/(1+tau*) - 1/sqrt5         == 0
    (1-tau*)/tau* - phi                      == 0
    2+phi - phi*sqrt5                        == 0
  hence gamma* = log((1-tau*)/tau*) / log(1/u*) = log(phi)/log(sqrt5)  EXACTLY.
  dpsi/dsigma formula (stationarity (S))     == 0
  d2psi/dsigma2 + [(1+g)/(1-rho)+1/rho](1+tau)/(g(1+sigma)^2) == 0
    => psi is STRICTLY CONCAVE in sigma on 0<rho<1: the interior
       stationary point is the GLOBAL inner max (no scan needed).
  dpsi/dgamma + (1+sigma) log(1-rho)         == 0
    => psi (hence Psi = max_sigma psi) is STRICTLY INCREASING in gamma
       at fixed tau: for gamma < gamma*, Psi(gamma,tau*) < H(tau*),
       so the CONTINUUM FLOOR DIRECTION is symbolic -- the numeric
       global-tau scan is NOT load-bearing for the lower bound.
  (K_b) general alphabet residual            == 0
    => tau* = phi^-2 universal in b; gamma*(b) = log(phi)/log((b+phi)/phi);
       b=2 special only through 2+phi = phi sqrt5.  PROVED-symbolic.
  THM-3009 (CLO)-residual - (M - 2L)         == 0
    => (CLO) <=> delta^2 = 1 - delta, root delta* = 1/phi.  PROVED-symbolic.
  sigma(gamma_hi) > 0  (exact Q(sqrt5) sign): True
  sigma(gamma_lo) < tau*  (exact):            True
    dsigma/dgamma = -rho*(1+tau*)/(1+gamma rho*)^2 < 0, so
    0 < sigma* in (0.038635396253, 0.038635396266) < tau*
    -- INTERIOR, certified via the exact rational bracket of PART 1
    + monotonicity.  UPGRADED from THM-3027's 3000-point scan.
