PART 4 -- EXACT AUTOPSY OF THE THM-3024 CROSS-SHELL HALL MODEL
==============================================================================
rate gamma = 71/125 = 0.568 (certified BELOW gamma*), shells [8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512]

4.1  per-shell (ARCH) verdicts (exact):
  m=   8: pass
  m=  16: pass
  m=  32: pass
